    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2948" root="بغل" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَغَّالٌ</span></b>  [n. un. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَغَّالَةٌ</span></b> , which is a coll. gen. n.,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمَّارَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّالَةٌ</span>, but explained by Freytag
as meaning “ he who possesses many mules; ”]
<i>An owner,</i> or <i>attendant,</i> (Sb, S,) <i>of mules,</i> (Sb,
TA,) or <i>of the mule.</i> (S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَغْلٌ</span>, with
which it is syn.

